{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03896","headline":"登东阳沈隐侯八咏楼 · 崔融","name":"登东阳沈隐侯八咏楼","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"旦登西北楼，楼峻石墉厚。\n宛生长定□，俯压三江口。\n排阶衔鸟衡，交疏过牛斗。\n左右会稽镇，出入具区薮。\n越岩森其前，浙江漫其後。\n此地实东阳，由来山水乡。\n隐侯有遗咏，落简尚余芳。\n具物昔未改，斯人今已亡。\n粤余忝藩左，束髪事文场。\n怅不见夫子，神期遥相望。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔融","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03896.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03896","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}